# Music Page (Locked)

The `/music` tab is **approved and locked**. Do not modify unless the operator **explicitly requests a music-page change in the active prompt** and **reconfirms** after you list every file you plan to touch.

## Protected surfaces

| Area | Role |
|------|------|
| `app/music/page.tsx` | Route entry |
| `components/music/*` | Page client, overlay, hotspots |
| `lib/music/assets.ts` | Artboard dimensions + PNG path |
| `app/globals.css` — `.music-page*` block only | Mobile track layout (do not edit this block unless music change is approved) |
| `public/music/*` | Background and cover PNGs |

## Required before any edit

1. Operator named music in the prompt — not inferred from adjacent work.
2. Agent lists all files to change and waits for explicit reconfirmation.
3. Preserve mobile-only artboard cap (`--mobile-app-track-w`, `object-fit: contain`).

## Forbidden without approval

- Hotspot retunes, PNG replacements, or layout refactors
- Adding desktop variants or full-bleed `100vw` stretch
- Unsolicited styling or cleanup in protected files
